From: PromethenDev <PromethenDev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 09:58:41 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 32/97] diagnostics: resolve log, readback range filter and
 guest read watch

Env-gated, off by default:
- WWE13_RESOLVE_LOG=1: one line per resolve (frame, destination, length, format, pitch/height).
- WWE13_READBACK_RANGE=lo-hi: with readback_resolve=full, read back only resolves whose
  destination intersects [lo, hi).
- WWE13_READWATCH_MIN=bytes: after a resolve at least this large, make its guest views
  inaccessible and log the first guest access (host PC and call chain), then restore access.

Used to trace WWE '13's black retro Shawn Michaels to XGUntileSurface reading composited
textures the CPU never received.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
